 "notes": "Source: OECD Economic Outlook annex workbook \"Demand and output\", sheet RealGDP (Annex Table 1. Real GDP), Internet Archive capture 20040205041642 of http://www.oecd.org/dataoecd/6/27/2483806.xls. The sheet says \"Source: OECD.\". Identified as EO74 (December 2003): saved 2003-12-22 (file metadata), annual columns end in 2005, and the values match the EO74 flash file (created 2003-11-26, capture 20040215112410 of http://www.oecd.org/dataoecd/18/26/2713584.xls). Values are annual percent change of real GDP, rounded here to 3 decimals (transcribed values keep the printed 1 decimal). Aggregates (OECD total, euro area) use the composition of the time. Not in source for this edition: China 2003, China 2004, India 2003, India 2004, Brazil 2003, Brazil 2004."
